    {
        "content": "<p>I tried from another windows computer, and it worked fine, so it's something with my setup.</p>\n<p>I tried on the original computer but from another clone, and it fails in the same way. So it's not an issue with a corrupt file in the specific directory where the issue first showed up.</p>",
