        "sender_full_name": "Sébastien Gouëzel",
        "timestamp": 1789587078
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Googling around, this looks like an issue with a git version which is too old. Let me try to update git to check it fixes the issue. A warning that git is too old might be useful for users, though.</p>",
        "id": 624754221,
        "sender_full_name": "Sébastien Gouëzel",
        "timestamp": 1789587203
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Updating git has fixed the issue. Turns out I had a git 2.21, installed in 2019 :-)</p>",
